# Byte-exactness matters here, so these must NOT be line-ending converted.
#
# The analysed-dataset cache is keyed on a CONTENT hash of the corpus CSV. If git
# rewrites CRLF to LF on checkout, the clone's bytes differ from the original,
# the hash changes, the cache misses and cold start goes from ~2s back to ~30s -
# silently. So the CSV and all build artefacts round-trip untouched.
*.pkl             binary
*.joblib          binary
data/*.csv        -text
frontend/dist/**  -text
